WEBVTT

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:36.270
Ball!

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:37.060
Walk!

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:39.930
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.510
Phoenix has gotten victories via walk-off home runs the last few games, on the other hand,

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:06.010
the Warriors lost their fourth game in a row.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.800
Here... eat.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:06.640
No!

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:13.800
Shigeno got one run in the first inning but didn't play well after that.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.520
It's good, so eat!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.860
I don't like tomatoes!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.450
In the top of the 3rd inning, with the seventh batter, Adachi...

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:22.900
The ball flew into the left field stands, resulting in a grand slam.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:25.660
The game went to the Arrows.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.670
This is the 10th season for Shigeno...

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:32.970
and there are rumors saying that he's retiring...

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:32.970
Hey, hey... What are you doing, Dad?

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.310
No!

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.450
If you keep being picky, I won't let you watch Hachi Man!

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.880
I don't want to!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.150
Be quiet! He said he doesn't want to eat, so just leave him alone!

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:45.450
Mind your own business!

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:49.690
You'll be late if you don't stop being so laidback.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.660
Geez... I've got problems of my own too.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.140
In the end, Fuji was the only one who joined.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:01.500
<i>I'd better hurry up and organize a game, and get the others to join...</i>

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.510
Yo, Goro, you going to school now?

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:14.250
Coming back in the morning again, Dad?

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:18.130
Mom's been in a bad mood since this morning, and I'm the one getting into trouble.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.470
What is it? Isn't it fine?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.300
I pitched last night, so it's okay for me to go and play Mahjong overnight.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.600
So... want me to drive you?

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.990
It's fine.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:33.200
If you're so free, rest your body well and prepare for the next game.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:37.420
It's because you're doing stuff like this that people are saying you're going to retire.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.510
Shut up!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.240
A kid shouldn't stick his nose into his parents' jobs!

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.840
W-What's up with him?

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.030
W-What's up with him?

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.240
Geez.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.920
A practice game?

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.920
There're only eight guys. How are you supposed to...

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:01.770
Besides, you guys haven't even been recognized as an official team yet.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.850
I simply can't organize a game.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:06.520
Then you can officially recognize us now.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:14.230
I understand.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:18.020
I will recognize you as an after-school club.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.070
After-school club?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:23.130
If that happens, I'll have to assign a teacher to be your advisor.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.610
H-Hold on a second, please!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.740
If it's an after-school club, we won't be able to participate in official tournaments.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:30.630
If you want the baseball team to be officially recognized,

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:35.680
it will depend on your activities 
and the advising teacher's judgment.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.380
Hey!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.970
Does anyone want to play catch?

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.400
Catch?

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:50.260
Yeah. That's because I've decided to play baseball with Shigeno.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.470
What did you say!?

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.580
{MISSING BACKGROUND 1} {Still can't make it out - Jezskye}

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.980
You guys are going to end up joining anyway, right?

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.980
What're you talking about? Tell me honestly.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.060
Won't it be better to get used to it?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.820
Hey, who said anything about joining?

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.850
That's what Shigeno said.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:03.610
What?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:08.800
Didn't you guys promise that all of you would join the team...

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:12.120
if he gets 27 strikeouts all by himself in a game?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.480
Oh, you were talking about <i>that.</i>

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.460
There's no way he's actually going to be able to do that.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:20.130
Why are you believing in such lies?

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.650
{Huh?}

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:23.240
Oh, I see...

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:27.630
You guys haven't seen him pitch yet, have you?

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.100
He's really amazing.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:35.390
If a nearby high school's our opponent,
they'll seriously get destroyed in a perfect game.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:39.550
With him around, Koshien isn't just a dream.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:43.670
I've decided. I'm going to dedicate my high school life to baseball!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.880
So, let's play catch.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.610
What an optimistic guy!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:51.320
If Shigeno's such an amazing player, why did he come to our school?

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.700
Well...

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.700
What Koshien?

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.540
In Kanagawa, there's still Kaido High School around.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.550
Such a dream is doomed from the very beginning.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:15.060
Damn! Those guys... Talking like they understand everything.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.360
What are you planning?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.650
You're trying to become an athlete starting now?

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.510
It's disgusting, so won't you please stop it?

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:30.360
It doesn't matter, does it?

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.370
It <i>does</i> matter.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:36.240
I joined the baseball team first.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:40.080
It's annoying if I have to see your face during team activities.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.800
Then you should quit.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:46.770
You're not fit to be a sports team manager either.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.430
You...

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.860
Do you have the right to speak to me like that?

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:57.560
Don't tell me that you forgot what you did to me.

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.100
<i>Fuji, what are you hurrying for?</i>

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.560
<i>I have Little League practice!</i>

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.980
<i>After all... I'm the ace and the fourth batter!</i>

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.910
<i>It... hurts.</i>

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.590
<i>She broke her thigh.</i>

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:36.220
<i>Nakamura-san set the record for the 100-meters event.</i>

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:40.050
<i>And now she can't even participate in the last tournament before graduation, right?</i>

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.560
<i>That's so pitiful!</i>

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.360
Since my rehabilitation took a while,

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.070
I had no choice but to give up track in junior high school,

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.000
and it was all because of you.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:57.390
You're hugely mistaken if you think it's over!

00:07:57.390 --> 00:08:00.940
I don't have any intention of ever forgiving you!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.470
<i>You've got to be kidding me.</i>

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:14.870
<i>I got the guys to join on the condition that they only need to show up for the games.</i>

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:22.640
<i>Regardless, I'll just have to satisfy the advisor by winning a game all by myself.</i>

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.980
<i>So that means... I need a game after all.</i>

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.610
<i>She said he was in the inner courtyard, didn't she?</i>

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:38.780
Do you need something?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:39.890
{Eh?}

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:41.800
W-Well...

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:46.170
I heard that the English teacher, Yamada-sensei, was in the inner courtyard, so...

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.250
Indeed.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.960
I'm Yamada Ichiro.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:53.420
F-Foreigner!?

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:55.270
No!

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.350
I'm not a foreigner.

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.690
I'm Japanese, Yamada Ichiro.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:00.760
Liar!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.730
You don't look Japanese at all!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.140
I'm not lying.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:10.830
I married a Japanese woman, whom I love,
and immigrated to Japan.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.280
I'm a genuine Japanese citizen.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:14.640
Well...

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:22.160
it's true that I was originally an American named Steve Timothy, who was born and raised in Minnesota.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.100
W-Well, forget it.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.220
Putting that aside,

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:31.370
you were recommended to be the advisor for the baseball team-

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.490
I've heard about it!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:40.600
You're the guy who wants to start a baseball team, Shige Nogoro-kun, right?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:45.270
Y-Yeah... but that's not where you split my name.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:48.100
I'll agree to take up the position.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.560
If you're okay with me,

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.360
I'll gladly accept the job of baseball team advisor, Nogoro-kun.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:56.080
Like I said, it's not Nogoro.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.780
Yama-chan's your advisor?

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.760
You know him?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.330
Of course I do!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:07.730
A foreigner as an English teacher;
he's noticeable even if you leave him alone!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:08.790
He's pretty popular.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.730
And he's funny!

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:12.740
Indeed, he is.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.760
By the way, does he know anything about baseball?

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:21.910
Well, he <i>is</i> from the country where baseball was born...

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.840
<i>Well, I guess I shouldn't get my hopes up.</i>

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:30.570
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:34.110
It's open!

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:37.060
How careless... I'm home-

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:47.800
Hey, Dad!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.500
Why are you sleeping in such a place?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.120
Where's Mom?

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:54.060
Shingo doesn't seem to be here either. Where's Chiharu?

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.300
Oh, it's you.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.340
Mom! Are you upstairs?

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:04.120
I'm hungry, so where's the food!?

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.430
If you're talking about her, she left the house.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.940
She took Shingo and Chiharu with her.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:14.030
Well, more accurately, I kicked them out.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.730
Kicked... them out?

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.940
Yeah. It's my house.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.450
Got a problem with that?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.870
So what are you going to do?

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:33.330
This is a free fansub.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:33.330
Not for sale or rent.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.260
I don't want to!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.330
I said I don't want to!

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.210
Why not?

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:41.420
For once, I'm saying I want to play a game together!

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:44.140
That's because baseball games are boring!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:49.360
What part of baseball is boring!?

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:51.680
Didn't you love it before!?

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:53.840
That hurts!

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.150
Wait a minute, what are you doing!?

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.030
He's telling you that hurts!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.560
Mama!

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:04.480
I just thought of playing a game with Shingo occasionally, that's all.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.530
You didn't have to force him to play, right?

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:10.330
Isn't it fine to just go along with what Shingo wants to play?

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.500
Be quiet.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:16.210
It's because you're spoiling him;
that's why Shingo's become so headstrong.

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:20.170
How can the son of a baseball player hate baseball!?

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:22.310
Shingo is Shingo!

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:25.670
It's not possible for all boys to become baseball players, is it!?

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.870
Will you knock it off?

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:36.900
After losing, you go drinking and only get back in the morning.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.360
You're frustrated about not winning,

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.900
but don't take it out on the kids!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.070
What?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.830
Enough already...

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.660
If you're going to be like this,

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.950
isn't it better for you to hurry up and retire?

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.460
You hit her?

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.450
Because of that, Mom...

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.910
Yeah, and after that she left.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:12.540
She's a failure as the wife of a pro baseball player.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.790
What the hell are you saying!?

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:17.130
You're a failure as a pro baseball player, too!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:17.730
What?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.510
Win or lose,

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:23.100
back then, you used to take proper care of your body!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:25.150
And what's become of that now?

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:28.980
No wonder Mom was driven to complain!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.160
What do you understand?

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.370
How long are you going to keep holding me?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.960
Let go!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.250
You bastard!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.450
Why you...!

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.630
You damn kid!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.680
Damn!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.230
It was going well.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:03.320
At training camp, everyone had higher hopes for me than usual.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.120
Mentally and physically, I thought I was in great condition,

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.030
but look how it ended up.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.050
My pitches aren't as strong and sharp,{my dad had a hard time explaining this one to me...}

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:14.510
and even when the pitch's location is perfect, batters are hitting them easily.

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:16.870
And there's nothing wrong with my body!

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:20.080
The Mahjong and drinking...

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.550
I've been trying them for a change of pace only because my coach suggested it.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.700
I've been desperate for help.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:27.780
Even so,

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.100
it's really pathetic of you.

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:32.540
You even hit Mom.

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.970
When I injured my shoulder and almost abandoned myself to despair,

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.060
what did you say to me?

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.740
<i>If you keep on sulking, I'm going to beat you up!</i>

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:44.940
<i>Shigeno Goro!</i>

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:50.910
Sulking, huh?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.530
Mom's probably at her parents' house.

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:59.500
She'll surely come back once she calms down.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:05.670
Goro,

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:12.330
I don't seriously think that all the children of baseball players have to love baseball.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.210
Just that,

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:18.980
when I think that if he begins to hate baseball because of my lousy pitching...

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:22.440
I can't stand it.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.130
Dad...

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:32.280
Now I understand...
why Honda tried so hard to become a batter.

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.820
He understood...

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:43.080
as a father, all he could leave you... was baseball.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.490
I feel the same way as Honda.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:53.970
The only thing I can leave you and Shingo is baseball.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:16:00.180
I also want to teach Shingo that "baseball is actually so amazing."

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.780
And until then...

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:03.300
Strike!

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:07.480
Hey, Shingo.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.730
It's about time to go home.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:12.420
Goro-niichan is probably starving.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:13.450
Just a bit more!

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.800
Just two more players and it'll be a perfect game!

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:18.280
Then just two more players, okay?

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:23.710
But... I didn't know that you were practicing baseball, Shingo.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:28.140
That's because <i>real</i> baseball's more fun than in games!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.150
All right! I hit the center again!

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:34.840
That's great, that's great!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.250
Well then...

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:45.790
you're going to become an even better player than your father and Goro-niichan soon, right?

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:48.070
You don't understand at all, Mama.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.720
Papa is the best pitcher among all the pro players!

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:56.200
There's no way I can be better than him unless I practice even more!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:01.610
That's why I'm going to practice a lot and surprise Papa!

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:09.400
My old man was a pitcher, on a farm team, suffering from a shoulder injury before he changed positions and became a batter.

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.000
But...

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:15.090
I always thought that he was cooler than anyone else.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.260
Man, the ball flew off somewhere weird.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.440
Momoko, I'm sorry.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.830
I...

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:36.980
It's okay.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.780
I'm sorry too.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:43.540
I didn't think about your feelings and said such...

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:47.980
Seriously, I'm a failure as the wife of a pro baseball player, huh?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:51.460
Momoko...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.530
<i>That's why I have a responsibility!</i>

00:17:57.530 --> 00:18:01.580
<i>As his best friend, I have a responsibility to look after you and Momoko-san,</i>

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.930
<i>the people whom he left behind, forever!</i>

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.730
Hey, Dad!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.990
If you've tried that hard and it still isn't working,

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:17.950
doesn't it mean that it's time to retire after all?

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.220
It's enough already.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:22.370
You've done a great job, Dad.

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.450
No one will complain if you take off your uniform at this point.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:30.220
Neither will Mom, Shingo, or I.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.420
And...

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.420
father too.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:49.240
Just leave the rest to me and Shingo!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:52.150
First, this eldest son will defeat Kaido...

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:56.440
and under the name of Shigeno Junior,
I'll make myself known in the baseball world.

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:00.870
{Ah!}

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.130
Papa and Goro-niichan!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.630
You can't watch!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.830
Since I'm training secretly!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.400
What are you saying Shingo?

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:13.510
Don't be petty. Show me your fastball.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.590
Then, I'll show you!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:19.150
But, before that,

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:20.900
Before we're aware of it, they're all grown up.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.930
after two strikes, you should throw while aiming for the corners, not the center.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:22.370
The children, that is.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:22.930
Yeah.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.180
I got it!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.950
All right, come!

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:29.060
That was fast!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.060
Strike!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:37.610
<i>I don't have any intention of ever forgiving you!</i>

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:43.740
<i>After all... I'm the ace and the clean-up batter!</i>

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.230
<i>In the end, after that...</i>

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:51.710
<i>I found baseball kind of bothersome, so I quit...</i>

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:57.460
<i>When I think about it, there hasn't been one thing that I've stayed with.</i>

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.690
<i>What Koshien?</i>

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:03.220
<i>In Kanagawa, there's still Kaido High School around.</i>

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:06.030
<i>He's right...</i>

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:10.300
<i>If we're going to lose anyway,
to start playing baseball now is...</i>

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.870
N-No, wait a minute!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:16.120
If I quit, then won't it be the same as before?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.330
I'm going to make baseball-

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.680
What are you mumbling about?

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:22.530
S-Shigeno!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.700
I-I definitely, definitely, definitely won't quit the baseball team, okay?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.370
What?

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.290
Of course you won't!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:34.000
If we lose any more members, this team will collapse before we can go up against Kaido!

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.950
You're right... Before we can go up against Kaido-

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.550
Kaido?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.670
If we don't go up against Kaido,

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:45.070
there'd be no point in me coming all the way to Seishuu, now would there?

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:46.660
W-Wait a minute!

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:50.560
If you wanted to play against Kaido, why did you come to Seishuu, where there's no baseball team?

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:53.680
Wouldn't it have been better to stay at your old school-

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.230
You know what?

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:57.940
If I was at Kaido, I wouldn't be able to play against Kaido, now would I?

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:06.060
You were on Kaido's baseball team!?

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:08.740
That's what I've been saying from the start!

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:14.760
Let's do it!

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:18.350
Whether it's Kaido or anywhere else, let's defeat them all!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.820
W-What's up with him?

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.090
Well, anything's fine.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:26.930
I'm counting on you because I have to show results.

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:29.140
Results?

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:34.600
You see, I'm going to lead the baseball world.

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:49.160
I, Yokohama Blue Ocean's Shigeno Hideki, will be retiring after this season.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:51.650
Strike! Batter out!

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:52.830
Game over!

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:56.000
You did it, Dad!

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:59.890
I didn't think it looked like the pitching of a retiring pitcher.

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:01.500
Stop saying stupid things.

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.840
It was a really tough third victory.

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.920
On top of that, Shingo fell asleep.

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:08.950
I wonder if...

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:10.970
But he saw it, you know?

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:14.560
Shingo saw your cool side.

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:16.770
I see.

00:22:24.910 --> 00:22:26.880
Yes, this is Shigeno.

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:30.600
Yes, please wait a second.

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:34.620
Goro? It's Yamada-san from Seishuu High.

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:35.470
Huh?

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:37.850
Hello?

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.210
Is this Nogoro-kun?

00:22:40.590 --> 00:22:42.210
I told you it's not Nogoro!

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.880
What do you want, calling me at this time?

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:48.420
The opponent for the exhibition game you wanted has been decided.

00:22:49.270 --> 00:22:52.430
Even within Kanagawa, they're strong and famous:

00:22:53.090 --> 00:22:55.310
Yokohama Teijin High School.

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:58.500
How about it, Nogoro-kun?

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:01.950
It's perfect.

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:07.330
Since we have to play anyway, the stronger the opponent, the more fired up we'll be!

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:13.040
ambient_88

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:13.040
Ryuu

00:24:40.840 --> 00:24:44.330
Our exhibition game's opponent is the famous Teijin High School.

00:24:44.330 --> 00:24:45.620
To establish a baseball team,

00:24:45.620 --> 00:24:48.340
I have to prove that, even on my own, I can win the game!

00:24:48.820 --> 00:24:50.050
Just you watch...

00:24:50.050 --> 00:24:53.040
I'll definitely get you guys to join the baseball team!

00:24:53.040 --> 00:24:54.090
Next time, on Major:

00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:55.430
Reckless Gamble!

00:24:55.800 --> 00:24:57.980
Run to the stage of your dreams!
